WEBVTT

00:02.240 --> 00:06.100
I found something wonderful, you know.

00:06.450 --> 00:06.970
What?

00:07.360 --> 00:07.770
This.

00:09.970 --> 00:10.700
A picture?

00:11.000 --> 00:12.780
Oh, this was in Ai's cradle...

00:13.080 --> 00:13.970
WHAT?

00:13.970 --> 00:15.980
This... AI!

00:18.550 --> 00:19.800
That's right.

00:20.340 --> 00:22.020
Oh, I won.

00:23.000 --> 00:25.200
Why is Ai in this picture?

00:25.370 --> 00:27.080
Is this picture from the future?

00:27.080 --> 00:31.330
I dunno, but I did notice one more thing.

00:31.450 --> 00:31.860
What?

00:33.620 --> 00:34.890
Hey, what, what?!

00:34.890 --> 00:36.140
Tell me, Sister Dearest!

00:36.220 --> 00:39.520
If you turn this winner in at the convenience store for me, okay?

00:39.520 --> 00:41.460
Later, I'll go later!

00:42.240 --> 00:44.910
Well, in that case... oh well.

00:45.340 --> 00:48.550
Think about the circumstances concerning how Ai's grown up.

00:48.840 --> 00:51.070
The circumstances... concerning how Ai's grown up?

00:52.200 --> 00:53.910
I DON'T KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT THAT!

00:53.910 --> 00:57.180
Make your brain work a little.

00:57.440 --> 00:58.300
Okay, ready?

00:59.200 --> 01:02.590
When we were in the living room and she left, she was still an elementary-schooler.

01:02.880 --> 01:06.580
When I brought over the barley tea, she had turned into a middle-schooler.

01:07.940 --> 01:10.310
That girl was looking at the photo.

01:10.460 --> 01:11.300
The photo?

01:11.670 --> 01:13.000
I don't get it at all.

01:13.810 --> 01:16.220
JEEZ! You sure are slow.

01:16.620 --> 01:22.060
My theory is that when that girl tries to remember something, she grows up.

01:22.060 --> 01:22.840
Oh yeah.

01:23.620 --> 01:29.700
When she said something about five days in her dream, she had grown up...

01:31.120 --> 01:32.360
Sis! You’re a genius!

01:32.360 --> 01:34.560
I'm not a candidate for goddess for nothing, ya know!

01:34.560 --> 01:36.650
Okay, off to the convenience store with you!

01:36.760 --> 01:37.540
HERE!

01:39.830 --> 01:41.770
He's ignoring my request?

02:01.800 --> 02:07.120
dare mo shiranai basho de

02:01.800 --> 02:07.120
In a place unknown to everyone

02:07.940 --> 02:12.800
asa ga umare hajimeru

02:07.940 --> 02:12.800
The dawn is being born

02:13.160 --> 02:19.240
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

02:13.160 --> 02:19.240
The wishes you made upon a star

02:19.240 --> 02:25.140
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

02:19.240 --> 02:25.140
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

02:25.440 --> 02:34.050
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

02:25.440 --> 02:34.050
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

02:37.240 --> 02:40.370
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

02:37.240 --> 02:40.370
And my voice envelops the entire world

02:40.390 --> 02:43.460
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

02:40.390 --> 02:43.460
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

02:43.480 --> 02:46.390
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

02:43.480 --> 02:46.390
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

02:46.640 --> 02:49.530
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

02:46.640 --> 02:49.530
And you'll never really lose them

02:49.530 --> 02:52.610
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

02:49.530 --> 02:52.610
My fingers touch all of creation

02:52.610 --> 02:58.000
tobira akete haruka kanata e

02:52.610 --> 02:58.000
Open the door and escape to a distant place

03:16.570 --> 03:19.900
A Precious Friend

03:16.570 --> 03:19.900
Translation: rabidkimba; Everything else: Chikushou

03:20.820 --> 03:21.460
Ai!

03:22.850 --> 03:23.480
Papa!

03:23.830 --> 03:28.890
I'm sorry... The thought of meeting Papa and Mama made me so happy, and...

03:28.890 --> 03:30.430
Don't worry about that.

03:30.630 --> 03:33.000
Anyway, have you remembered anything?

03:33.030 --> 03:33.410
Eh?

03:33.990 --> 03:35.000
What is it?

03:35.000 --> 03:36.190
Did something happen just now?

03:36.190 --> 03:38.130
Just try to remember something, okay?

03:38.470 --> 03:41.050
Like what you were saying in in the bathroom earlier.

03:41.050 --> 03:45.590
Um... I had a dream that said I could only be here for five days...

03:45.620 --> 03:51.780
And then, when I looked at that picture, I had the feeling that I needed to find something really important, and...

03:51.780 --> 03:52.360
It's this, isn't it?

03:54.220 --> 03:58.610
Yeah. To me, this girl is really...

03:59.020 --> 04:01.420
Oh yeah, Ai. Let me look at your back.

04:04.570 --> 04:05.820
Don't get the wrong idea!

04:05.820 --> 04:06.480
Look!

04:10.770 --> 04:12.710
There's a lot more than last time.

04:12.880 --> 04:14.380
Maybe they're some sort of letters?

04:14.380 --> 04:16.180
I can't read what it says, though.

04:17.680 --> 04:19.330
What? Did you figure something out?

04:20.520 --> 04:21.710
Now that you mention it...

04:22.370 --> 04:25.960
That girl at the hospital was talking about it too... having dreams.

04:26.570 --> 04:27.410
Dreams?

04:29.000 --> 04:31.660
The devil beckons her to follow her somewhere, but...

04:32.120 --> 04:35.970
A girl appears and tells her not to go with the devil.

04:37.330 --> 04:39.240
That's why she was always...

04:39.880 --> 04:41.900
Waiting for that girl, she said.

04:42.250 --> 04:44.600
Okay. So what? What's that mean?

04:44.970 --> 04:48.360
Oh, well I thought there might be some kind of connection or something.

04:48.730 --> 04:49.540
I...

04:50.470 --> 04:52.210
Had the same kind of dream.

04:52.500 --> 04:53.390
Ai?

04:53.680 --> 04:58.340
We were in a dark world, and something important to me is about to be taken away by the devil.

04:58.600 --> 05:05.690
But then I ask that important thing, "Wait a little longer, I'll be there soon!"

05:06.560 --> 05:08.760
That devil... what's it like?

05:09.190 --> 05:10.210
A girl.

05:10.640 --> 05:11.250
Red...

05:12.260 --> 05:14.140
A girl wearing a one piece.

05:14.140 --> 05:15.330
A red one piece!

05:15.650 --> 05:16.740
What is it?

05:16.740 --> 05:18.250
What about a red one piece?

05:18.250 --> 05:21.750
Tenko, we're skipping school and going to the hospital tomorrow.

05:21.750 --> 05:23.750
The hospital? Why?

05:23.750 --> 05:26.470
Ai is probably looking for that girl.

05:27.020 --> 05:29.300
If we can meet that girl, I think we'll figure something out.

05:38.530 --> 05:41.170
Hey Papa, can I hug you?

05:41.600 --> 05:42.470
Yeah...

05:49.590 --> 05:51.560
Papa, why am I alive?

05:52.050 --> 05:52.710
Eh?

05:53.810 --> 05:58.500
Yeah... well, I've got my own special circumstances, too.

05:58.700 --> 06:00.210
I heard during lunch...

06:00.500 --> 06:02.290
Big sis is a goddess, right?

06:03.830 --> 06:05.790
SHE TOLD YOU?

06:06.260 --> 06:09.790
Well, I guess I can tell you, then. I'm the Son of God.

06:09.790 --> 06:12.280
So that's it! You're a god!

06:12.770 --> 06:16.500
But then why are you living as a human?

06:17.250 --> 06:19.190
To get to know humans better, I guess?

06:19.540 --> 06:22.550
What they live to think about, and how they live.

06:22.550 --> 06:26.050
If I can get to know that better, I'll become a great god.

06:26.220 --> 06:28.860
I guess that's what I'm living for, right now. Basically.

06:29.750 --> 06:32.130
That's pretty incredible! I respect you a lot!

06:33.260 --> 06:37.050
Nah... I don't think it's anything that big.

06:38.580 --> 06:42.490
You know, I think I'm living for that girl I'm going to meet tomorrow.

06:42.980 --> 06:44.830
At least I get that kind of feeling.

06:49.610 --> 06:51.170
Oh, that's right.

06:53.050 --> 06:54.180
This.

06:55.870 --> 07:00.710
It'd be nice to meet you again.
-Ai

06:56.640 --> 06:57.910
What's that?

06:58.550 --> 07:00.080
It was in your cradle.

07:12.210 --> 07:15.100
Oh yeah, so it was like that.

07:15.100 --> 07:16.050
What is it?

07:16.050 --> 07:17.300
What do you mean?

07:17.880 --> 07:18.920
I...

07:19.300 --> 07:20.220
I'm not Ai.

07:22.300 --> 07:24.270
Ai is my friend.

07:24.820 --> 07:27.570
I came here to find Ai.

07:28.700 --> 07:31.420
I don't really understand a word of what you're saying, but...

07:31.590 --> 07:33.910
If you're not Ai, then who are you?

07:35.440 --> 07:37.500
I think I'll find out tomorrow.

07:37.900 --> 07:39.200
Good night.

07:39.230 --> 07:41.200
Hey, Ai. Ai!

07:53.040 --> 07:53.620
Perv.

07:53.700 --> 07:54.800
I'm not a perv!

07:54.800 --> 07:55.930
Ai did that on her own!

07:57.700 --> 08:00.730
Ai wasn't really Ai, was she?

08:01.460 --> 08:02.790
Then I wonder who she is.

08:03.250 --> 08:05.160
Well, I have no idea.

08:05.940 --> 08:07.820
Something might end tomorrow.

08:08.340 --> 08:09.940
Or maybe something's going to start.

08:10.340 --> 08:13.380
Either way, something's going to happen.

08:16.940 --> 08:19.250
I wonder if Ai is going away?

08:20.060 --> 08:22.090
Things really will be sad, then...

08:22.380 --> 08:23.250
Tenko...

08:23.650 --> 08:25.010
G-Good night!

08:47.120 --> 08:49.060
Papa, Mama, good morning!

08:49.060 --> 08:50.160
T-this is...

08:50.330 --> 08:52.620
Yeah... The girl from the hospital!

08:58.060 --> 09:01.530
Hm? Were Samatarou and Tenko just...

09:01.530 --> 09:02.750
Were they here?

09:02.750 --> 09:04.280
Or weren't they?

09:13.160 --> 09:13.950
Ai.

09:15.360 --> 09:17.390
It's me! Do you remember?

09:17.680 --> 09:19.070
You remember, right?

09:20.800 --> 09:23.030
You waited all this time, after all!

09:23.810 --> 09:25.670
L-Lulu?

09:25.950 --> 09:27.430
Yeah! It's me!

09:27.580 --> 09:28.650
I wanted to see you!

09:32.180 --> 09:33.300
What's wrong, Ai?

09:33.300 --> 09:34.690
Why are you running away?

09:34.810 --> 09:36.490
We finally were able to meet!

09:37.120 --> 09:38.980
S..top.

09:40.540 --> 09:42.540
Ai... I love you!

09:42.560 --> 09:43.640
Stop!

09:44.530 --> 09:46.100
I hate you!

09:46.440 --> 09:47.890
Hurry up and get out of here!

09:47.890 --> 09:50.380
What's wrong, Ai? It's me!

09:50.380 --> 09:51.970
I did all of this to meet up with you again...

09:53.760 --> 09:55.440
Why would you do something like this?

09:56.080 --> 09:58.340
Is teasing me that much fun?

09:59.090 --> 10:01.580
Don't say bad things about Papa and Mama!

10:01.920 --> 10:04.620
They're the ones who raised me to be the person I am today!

10:04.300 --> 10:05.340
Shut up!

10:06.290 --> 10:08.930
Go home! Leave right now!

10:15.580 --> 10:17.670
Ai! Er, no, umm...

10:18.820 --> 10:21.020
What is it? Do you have a problem?

10:24.640 --> 10:27.680
What are you doing, you idiot!

10:27.970 --> 10:29.410
You're the idiot!

10:31.440 --> 10:32.220
Tenko!

10:34.710 --> 10:36.480
I don't get it...

10:37.310 --> 10:38.990
Do you think you could explain?

10:39.220 --> 10:40.180
So that I could understand...

10:42.320 --> 10:46.550
To me, Lulu was... my only friend.

10:47.360 --> 10:49.410
From the moment I was born, we were together.

10:49.670 --> 10:53.260
I really thought that if I had Lulu, I wouldn't need anyone else.

10:53.810 --> 10:57.770
But then when we were in junior high... A gust of wind made us fall from a pedestrian bridge.

10:59.250 --> 11:00.060
LULU!

11:08.620 --> 11:10.770
My memory after that's blank...

11:12.300 --> 11:14.670
Once I came to, I was in this hospital.

11:15.510 --> 11:19.240
When I asked about Lulu, no one would answer me.

11:20.780 --> 11:25.760
And like that, my only friend disappeared.

11:27.030 --> 11:31.430
Oh... so what you were looking at all this time was that bridge, wasn't it.

11:31.660 --> 11:34.870
That was the last place that Lulu and I were together.

11:35.450 --> 11:39.730
I had hoped that I'd be able to meet Lulu again if I just kept looking at that bridge.

11:40.920 --> 11:43.640
Your wish to see Lulu again came true.

11:45.320 --> 11:47.630
But there's no way something like that could happen.

11:47.920 --> 11:52.230
It's impossible for someone who left this world like Lulu to just suddenly appear again like that.

11:52.230 --> 11:53.880
The impossible happens!

11:54.900 --> 11:56.950
Because that's what I, a god, says!

11:56.950 --> 11:58.370
I'm sure about it!

12:00.080 --> 12:02.680
A god? You say some funny things.

12:03.320 --> 12:04.360
Do you know what this is?

12:06.010 --> 12:07.310
This is my...

12:07.660 --> 12:09.740
When Lulu came to our house, she had this.

12:10.150 --> 12:12.520
When she saw it, she started to cry.

12:12.920 --> 12:14.980
I think your heart reached out and found her.

12:15.990 --> 12:18.190
But I can't believe that!

12:18.510 --> 12:19.520
I mean, I'm...!

12:19.520 --> 12:22.240
You can't put your faith in me or Tenko!

12:22.500 --> 12:24.610
You've gotta trust what's in your and Lulu's hearts!

12:25.080 --> 12:27.390
You wished for a miracle!

12:27.570 --> 12:30.600
So why would you be running away from that miracle?!

12:32.340 --> 12:35.900
Lulu is probably waiting for you at that bridge.

12:36.330 --> 12:39.660
Don't you think that it's your turn to meet Lulu?

12:40.910 --> 12:41.800
There's no way...

12:43.190 --> 12:44.580
There's no way, but...

12:45.770 --> 12:50.430
If Lulu was at that bridge, I...

12:53.580 --> 12:54.680
Um...

12:55.550 --> 12:59.170
Oh, excuse me! I'm Kamiyama, Ai's friend, and...

12:59.400 --> 13:02.060
Ai's friend? It couldn't...

13:02.180 --> 13:04.260
I'm Ai's mother.

13:05.100 --> 13:08.630
She hasn't made any friends before.

13:08.630 --> 13:10.890
To say that you're her friend...

13:11.260 --> 13:13.200
Is that true?

13:13.780 --> 13:20.060
Yes, before she was hospitalized, she shut herself into our house, and a doll was her only friend.

13:20.260 --> 13:21.330
A doll?

13:23.760 --> 13:25.470
Thank you, ma'am!

13:26.400 --> 13:27.350
Are she serious?

13:27.350 --> 13:28.390
That means...

13:40.940 --> 13:45.140
So you were Lulu? And that girl was Ai.

13:48.350 --> 13:50.700
Ai should come here...

13:51.220 --> 13:54.620
If I wait here, then she'll believe that I'm Lulu.

13:55.840 --> 13:56.390
Ai...

13:58.580 --> 13:59.180
Lulu!

14:00.040 --> 14:00.790
Ai!

14:03.520 --> 14:05.820
I still don't believe you!

14:06.260 --> 14:07.510
How could I?

14:07.670 --> 14:11.900
After disappearing four years ago... You walking and talking...

14:12.010 --> 14:13.420
There's no way you could be alive!

14:13.420 --> 14:15.910
I came to meet you, Ai-chan!

14:15.910 --> 14:17.070
Really!

14:20.110 --> 14:21.800
Lulu, watch this!

14:21.960 --> 14:25.390
This world is just a dream and you're a fake!

14:25.750 --> 14:29.480
I'll show you...

14:30.840 --> 14:32.250
What are you doing, Ai?

14:32.440 --> 14:33.690
You can't walk, can you?!

14:35.040 --> 14:40.820
If this is a world where Lulu is alive and can talk to me... I should be able to walk!

14:42.170 --> 14:44.410
I can cheat this world, too!

14:53.260 --> 14:55.940
She isn't real... She's just a fake.

14:56.600 --> 15:00.420
But, even so, I want to meet her, no matter what!

15:01.170 --> 15:05.870
I want to be together and be friends forever, just like it was back then!

15:06.230 --> 15:07.280
Ai!

15:11.510 --> 15:12.780
A-are you okay?

15:12.780 --> 15:14.880
Mama! I'm sorry.

15:15.020 --> 15:16.370
Just let her be.

15:16.590 --> 15:18.200
But that's ridiculous!

15:18.580 --> 15:19.830
I believe in her.

15:20.300 --> 15:22.590
That's why I want to wait here!

15:24.140 --> 15:27.370
Lulu, I was scared.

15:27.930 --> 15:33.290
The devil showed up in my dreams and told me, "You should go ahead and die".

15:33.710 --> 15:36.880
But were always there to stop me, Lulu.

15:37.770 --> 15:42.800
"Wait a little longer. I'll be there soon", that's what you said.

15:46.950 --> 15:48.520
That's why I waited!

15:48.910 --> 15:50.620
I waited all this time for you, Lulu!

15:50.960 --> 15:55.490
Before I came here, I was always thinking about you, too!

15:55.680 --> 16:00.160
I knew you were in pain and that you were waiting!

16:00.160 --> 16:02.240
That's why I wanted to meet you as soon as I could!

16:02.400 --> 16:04.780
Look! This is proof!

16:04.550 --> 16:08.800
My precious friend

16:15.700 --> 16:18.800
Lulu... it really is you, Lulu!

16:25.100 --> 16:25.680
Ai!

16:30.740 --> 16:31.430
Lulu...

16:31.760 --> 16:32.810
Ai.

16:34.140 --> 16:37.710
Why were you able to come to me?

16:38.010 --> 16:40.610
Because you wrote that you wanted to meet me again.

16:41.050 --> 16:42.020
Oh yeah.

16:42.020 --> 16:44.670
So <i>tanabata</i> wishes take time to come true.

16:45.000 --> 16:45.530
Yeah.

16:47.660 --> 16:49.900
But gods really do exist.

16:51.690 --> 16:52.940
They really do.

16:54.980 --> 16:57.470
Nooooo!

17:02.080 --> 17:02.670
No!

17:08.420 --> 17:10.490
Samatarou! Shinichi!

17:10.940 --> 17:12.950
Oh man, I'm relieved! I'm gonna puke!

17:12.950 --> 17:15.280
What are you doing, hold it in, hold it in!

17:15.280 --> 17:17.520
Oh, everyone's safe...

17:18.700 --> 17:19.810
Thank goodness.

17:20.000 --> 17:20.830
Tenko!

17:20.830 --> 17:23.240
Wasn't that pretty god-like of me?

17:23.240 --> 17:25.730
Yeah! You were totally cool!

17:30.090 --> 17:34.190
We came home with those two still in the hospital. I wonder if it's okay...

17:34.240 --> 17:35.370
Who knows.

17:35.820 --> 17:38.800
But involving ourselves any more than this, I don't know...

17:39.380 --> 17:41.620
I think that they've figured it out on their own.

17:41.870 --> 17:43.560
Now you should make some time for me!

17:44.000 --> 17:45.000
Tomorrow, okay?

17:45.000 --> 17:46.240
Cheapskate.

17:46.540 --> 17:50.750
But you know, it's a little sad without her around.

17:50.910 --> 17:53.650
You were pretty attached to her.

17:53.680 --> 17:55.030
Mama!

17:55.420 --> 17:57.660
Things were fun after Ai showed up.

17:58.020 --> 17:59.260
It was like we had a family.

18:00.560 --> 18:02.190
You have a family!

18:02.440 --> 18:04.680
Pops, Ma, Sis, Meme.

18:05.090 --> 18:06.420
That's a little different.

18:06.970 --> 18:10.100
Mama isn't really my mom. Same with Papa.

18:11.340 --> 18:18.000
But Ai was like my own child, and I thought that maybe we'd have a real family some day.

18:18.000 --> 18:19.610
Don't say stupid things like that!

18:19.610 --> 18:24.220
Outsiders become part of families all the time!

18:24.610 --> 18:26.300
What do you mean by that?

18:26.410 --> 18:27.380
Well...

18:29.120 --> 18:31.000
I don't know exactly, but probably...

18:31.440 --> 18:35.560
The two of us'll become a real family one day.

18:36.170 --> 18:37.410
Sama..ta...

18:39.790 --> 18:40.200
Tenko.

18:53.670 --> 18:55.630
Why are you laughing so much?!

18:55.630 --> 18:57.180
I think we've had enough for today!

18:57.370 --> 18:58.750
It'll just become a joke!

18:58.750 --> 19:01.660
Whatever! I hate you, Samatarou!

19:01.660 --> 19:02.850
Hey, wait up!

19:02.850 --> 19:04.500
Why're you getting so mad?

19:17.690 --> 19:19.570
What... was that.....

19:19.570 --> 19:21.260
An accident! That was an accident!

19:21.510 --> 19:22.780
But our lips...

19:22.780 --> 19:23.750
They didn't touch!

19:24.000 --> 19:27.450
Okay, maybe they did, but that wasn't a kiss!

19:27.450 --> 19:28.140
Probably!

19:28.140 --> 19:29.520
Kiss?

19:43.210 --> 19:45.860
That was your doing, wasn't it, Pops?

19:45.860 --> 19:47.000
Oh, Samatarou!

19:47.220 --> 19:48.100
Why are you...

19:48.100 --> 19:49.260
Meme told me.

19:49.260 --> 19:53.130
Anyway, all of what just happened, that was all your fault, right?

19:54.650 --> 19:59.460
Sorry, I may be God, but I can't control everything.

19:59.820 --> 20:02.200
So are you saying you had nothing to do with it?

20:02.200 --> 20:03.920
Well, I wonder...

20:04.140 --> 20:07.320
I guess the beginning was my fault, but the rest was all chance.

20:07.730 --> 20:08.970
I don't get it.

20:09.640 --> 20:10.580
Come over here.

20:13.180 --> 20:14.530
What is this?

20:14.920 --> 20:18.130
Wishes. Or maybe they're more like volition.

20:18.680 --> 20:23.410
You see, humans are beings that wish for things, but they're also beings that hold onto their desires.

20:23.820 --> 20:25.400
They don't give up.

20:25.780 --> 20:28.240
They can keep thinking "just maybe..." as long as they want.

20:28.710 --> 20:34.570
But only wishes that come from the heart make it all the way here.

20:34.820 --> 20:37.780
I fish those up and make them come true.

20:38.580 --> 20:42.320
So that's what it was. That paper came from here.

20:42.920 --> 20:44.640
By the way, Samatarou.

20:44.830 --> 20:48.150
You told a human that you're a god, didn't you?

20:48.400 --> 20:49.480
Ahh, that's...

20:49.670 --> 20:52.190
That's a problem, breaking laws like that.

20:52.300 --> 20:55.560
There's a set punishment for things like this.

20:56.190 --> 20:59.930
Time's going to reset right before they found out you're a god.

20:59.930 --> 21:02.220
And then as a punishment, you'll be in a lot of pain.

21:02.750 --> 21:03.770
Pain?

21:03.770 --> 21:05.210
You know full well...

21:05.370 --> 21:09.460
What happens when humans wish for a long time.

21:09.460 --> 21:11.150
Um, I don't know what you're saying...

21:11.340 --> 21:13.390
You'll figure it out soon enough.

21:13.610 --> 21:15.130
The incredible pain, that is!

21:19.200 --> 21:20.270
Samatarou!

21:20.490 --> 21:21.410
What's happened?

21:21.410 --> 21:22.490
Are they okay?

21:23.450 --> 21:28.040
Pops... you didn't have to turn back time this far...

21:29.950 --> 21:32.110
Owwwwww....

21:30.640 --> 21:32.160
You reap what you sow.

21:32.160 --> 21:34.320
It's good that you got off with just a sprain.

21:34.570 --> 21:35.920
It's not good!

21:36.090 --> 21:36.830
Um...

21:39.400 --> 21:39.960
Ai.

21:39.960 --> 21:43.500
Well yes, my name is Tachibana Ai, but...

21:43.740 --> 21:45.740
Are you the Kirishima that gave me this letter?

21:45.740 --> 21:48.580
Yes! I'm Kirishima!

21:48.670 --> 21:49.940
You read my letter, didn't you?

21:49.940 --> 21:50.550
Thank you!

21:50.550 --> 21:53.500
Okay, let's go on a date now!

21:53.640 --> 21:55.270
What? A date?

21:53.750 --> 21:55.300
So, where you wanna go?

21:55.300 --> 21:57.650
I'm like, totally free, and like, up for anything!

21:56.240 --> 21:58.090
So he wasn't even hurt...

21:58.560 --> 22:00.250
And on top of that, a love letter?

22:01.020 --> 22:01.880
What's wrong?

22:01.880 --> 22:02.930
Your face is red.

22:02.930 --> 22:04.700
I just remembered something...

22:05.420 --> 22:07.960
You know, that kiss!

22:08.320 --> 22:09.400
Do you not remember?

22:09.400 --> 22:12.050
O-of course I remember!

22:12.030 --> 22:14.600
That peck on the cheek!

22:16.310 --> 22:17.970
So she doesn't remember after all...

22:16.530 --> 22:17.940
Oh you......

22:18.630 --> 22:20.400
Pops, you....

22:20.400 --> 22:23.890
IS THIS MY INCREDIBLE PAIN?

22:23.890 --> 22:26.820
What's wrong, Samatarou? Hey!

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
Oh please, God! Allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
kotaenasai

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:01.400 --> 24:02.900
For Kamiyama Tenko

24:03.780 --> 24:04.550
What should I do?

24:04.550 --> 24:05.850
I got a love letter!

24:05.850 --> 24:06.870
Do whatever you want!

24:07.120 --> 24:08.310
It's your choice!

24:08.580 --> 24:11.410
A god-in-training and a guardian angel.

24:11.680 --> 24:14.250
Our lives change.

24:14.250 --> 24:15.580
I don't understand!

24:15.580 --> 24:17.870
Business as usual for you two, I see.

24:18.040 --> 24:19.200
Kumiko!

24:19.280 --> 24:21.050
You... why?

24:21.550 --> 24:25.090
Next time on Kamisama Kazoku: First Love, Again...

24:25.260 --> 24:27.580
Komori Kumiko is back!
